{% comment %}
  Won Discounts — sale badge (MVP 5, Výprodej; contract O9, docs/plans/2026-10-02-won-discounts-mvp5.md).
  App block, product template only. Reads the product metafield `outlet` the sale writes:
  {"d": display, "v": {"<variant numeric id>": pieces left}, "e": {"<variant numeric id>": end, epoch seconds}}
  (absent = nothing on sale; `e` only for a sale with an end date).
  Since 10 Oct 2026 each sale says for itself what shows: `s` {"<variant id>": 0 nothing | 1 badge | 2 badge and
  pieces left} and `m` {"<variant id>": the merchant's own badge text, "{left}" = the pieces left}. A variant
  without an `s` entry (a sale from before) follows `d` as below.
  A sale whose badge the merchant hid for its variant is simply not in `v` (the app leaves it out).
  - silent / strike: nothing here (the theme strikes compare_at_price itself);
  - strike_badge: "Výprodej"; strike_badge_left: + "Zbývá X ks" (X > 0, the real quota).
  One row per sale variant, and only the row of the variant the shopper has picked is shown (feedback 9 Oct 2026,
  3rd round, bod 6: every sale variant listed by name read as "Sale 400 g" and said nothing). Liquid shows the
  variant the page was rendered for; assets/won-discounts-blocks.js follows the shopper's pick (loaded only for a
  product with more variants, or a sale with a countdown). A variant that is not on sale shows no badge.
  Never reads or changes the cart (SF-1). Markers data-won-discounts-outlet*.
  In the theme editor a product with nothing on sale shows a labelled sample (7th round, bod 2: an empty block
  could be neither seen nor placed); a customer never sees it.
  The looks with a countdown (the storefront config's `appearance.oc`; the look itself is CSS in the config's
  stylesheet) add the time left to a sale that has an end: the campaign banner's countdown markup and script
  (assets/won-discounts-blocks.js), loaded only then.
{% endcomment %}
{%- comment -%} The badge itself: snippets/won-outlet.liquid (the embed renders it for a tag too). {%- endcomment -%}
{%- render 'won-outlet', attrs: block.shopify_attributes, scripts: true -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Sale badge",
  "target": "section",
  "enabled_on": {
    "templates": ["product"]
  },
  "stylesheet": "won-discounts-outlet.css",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
